# Agreement Duration and Renewal Cycle

This scope calculates the initial expiry date and subsequent renewal dates for the cooperation agreement.

```catala
declaration scope AgreementDuration:
  input start_date content date
  input initial_duration content duration
  input renewal_duration content duration
  output initial_expiry_date content date
  output next_renewal_date content date
```

The initial expiry date is determined by adding the initial period of 10 years to the date the parties specify for entry into force.

```catala
scope AgreementDuration:
  date round down
  definition initial_expiry_date equals start_date + initial_duration
  definition next_renewal_date equals initial_expiry_date + renewal_duration
```

The agreement shall be automatically renewed for five-year periods, and the next renewal date is calculated by adding the renewal duration to the initial expiry date.